1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,345
New Year's Day, 2023.

2
00:00:02,345 --> 00:00:08,505
Y-G posts a trailer with a name and almost nothing else: BABYMONSTER — Next Movement.

3
00:00:08,505 --> 00:00:12,654
Sixty seconds of silhouettes, studio footage, and a logo.

4
00:00:12,654 --> 00:00:13,865
No faces.

5
00:00:13,865 --> 00:00:14,935
No names.

6
00:00:14,935 --> 00:00:16,249
No debut date.

7
00:00:16,249 --> 00:00:23,891
It collected millions of views in days, because after seven years of waiting, the heirs to BLACKPINK finally had a name.

